			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140340201,
					"content": "於是，「魔物」被擊潰、「巫師」被討伐…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德飾"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340202,
					"content": "在那之後，王城重新迎來了和平的日子。那些被蠱惑的王臣，也看清了自己犯下的罪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德飾"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340203,
					"content": "有人記住了那幾位英雄的名字，他們拯救了這個國家…當然，也有人一無所知地繼續過著自己的日子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德飾"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340204,
					"content": "這就是「逐影獵人」。他們追尋森森鬼影，並將其盡數驅逐、獵殺…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德飾"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340205,
					"content": "不論人們銘記與否，他們永遠守護著這座城市，守護著人們的生活…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德飾"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340206,
					"content": "呼…這就算正式結團了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340207,
					"content": "嗯，你們完成了一個好結局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340208,
					"content": "不錯的故事。原本以為只是個普通的冒險劇本，但越到後面越覺得它設計巧妙，製作精良。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340209,
					"content": "特別是最後那場決戰，做得也太逼真了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340210,
					"content": "呃…哈哈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340211,
					"content": "啊…的確呢，沒想到我們從「寶藏」中得到的武器，還有著那樣的效果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340212,
					"content": "對啊，它們在我手上發光的時候，還嚇了我一跳呢。我剛才研究了好一陣子，但再沒看見它亮起來過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340213,
					"content": "哦，這些武器都是道具，要回收的對吧？我先放這了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340214,
					"content": "芙寧娜玩得開心嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340215,
					"content": "當然，如果下次有類似的桌上劇團，也記得叫上我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340216,
					"content": "好，沒問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340217,
					"content": "那我就先回去了，路上還想好好回味一下呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340218,
					"content": "等弗洛萊恩先生醒過來，幫忙傳達一下我的問候。真是辛苦他了，從剛才開始就累得睡了過去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340219,
					"content": "妳說得對，是滿辛苦的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340220,
					"content": "嗯，那各位改天見！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙寧娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340221,
					"content": "…現在…總可以問了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340222,
					"content": "我覺得應該可以了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340223,
					"content": "這究竟是怎麼一回事啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340224,
					"content": "…原來你們早就發現了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340225,
					"content": "啊哈哈…山洞裡閉眼的那場…很難不被發現吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340226,
					"content": "我可是忍到現在才問的！因為克洛琳德妳一副無事發生的樣子，而且芙寧娜看起來根本沒有察覺到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340227,
					"content": "看來，我們誰都不希望揭開幻想的紗幕呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340228,
					"content": "欸？你們在說什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340229,
						140340231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340229,
					"content": "你們在說什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340230,
					"content": "#什麼！原來好搭檔{M#你}{F#妳}也…！啊…抱歉抱歉，{M#你}{F#妳}現在捂起耳朵還來得及！乾脆我來幫你捂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340233,
					"content": "這…再怎麼也晚了點吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340234,
					"content": "欸？你們的意思難道是…剛才發生的那些，不是劇本裡安排好的橋段？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340235,
					"content": "不如說從一開始，這就不是一個普通的桌上劇團。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340236,
					"content": "欸欸欸？！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340237,
					"content": "…好吵…頭好痛啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340238,
					"content": "你快給我起來！起來！這究竟是怎麼回事啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340239,
					"content": "啊啊啊！不、不要搖！我的頭…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340240,
					"content": "弗洛萊恩一五一十地向其他人解釋了事情經過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340241,
					"content": "我、我沒聽錯吧？這劇本的後半段都是你們現場編出來的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340242,
					"content": "騙人很可惡，但弗洛萊恩編故事好厲害。克洛琳德的臨場發揮也是！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340243,
					"content": "簡直像魔術師上場發現忘帶道具，臨時創作了一段精彩的魔術一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340244,
					"content": "要是我知道寶庫有問題，可能早就怕得要死，轉頭溜走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340245,
					"content": "都是小場面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340246,
					"content": "你口中就沒有大場面，但隨便挑一個說出來都能把人嚇個不輕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340247,
					"content": "可能我習慣了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340248,
					"content": "呃…妳的生活是有多刺激…難怪當主持人的時候，什麼情況都應付得來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340249,
					"content": "至於弗洛萊恩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340250,
					"content": "…我沒有什麼好辯駁的。我這就前往警備隊，陳述自己所犯的罪，接受懲罰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340251,
					"content": "我倒覺得，你受的懲罰已經夠多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340252,
					"content": "…什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340253,
					"content": "雖然一開始被功利所矇蔽，但你在決戰中的行為，證明了自己是位合格的逐影獵人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340254,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340255
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340255,
					"content": "對這座城市來說，你繼續做好逐影獵人的工作或許更重要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340256
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340256,
					"content": "可是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340257
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340257,
					"content": "當然，你還是要帶著鑰匙，去向其他兩位逐影獵人道歉，並且承擔對方所提出的補償條件。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340258
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340258,
					"content": "…我明白。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340259
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340259,
					"content": "但除此以外…你已經在和我的「決鬥」中，證明了自己的名譽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340260
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340260,
					"content": "…好…就按妳說的辦。我…這就去歸還那兩把鑰匙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340261
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340261,
					"content": "謝謝你們。我不會辜負你們給予我的第二次機會，我以逐影獵人的身分起誓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340262
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340262,
					"content": "那麼…後會有期。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛萊恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340231,
					"content": "其實我也發現了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340232,
					"content": "什麼！原來派蒙也沒發現？啊…抱歉抱歉，妳現在捂起耳朵還來得及！乾脆我來幫妳捂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜維婭"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1403403,
